      "updated": 1776428531659,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- call lands to Short Url service\n- it calls Id generator to get the unique\nshort Url\n- save the mapping the database\n    - get db instance by using long_url\n    - save the entry in the db\n- return the short url to the user",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- call lands to Short Url service\n- it calls Id generator to get the unique short Url\n- save the mapping the database\n    - get db instance by using long_url\n    - save the entry in the db\n- return the short url to the user",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
