      "text": "- Used debezium here which reads the\nmessages from the WAL\n- push them in the Kafka\n- Consumers\n    - database consumer \n        - reads the message from the kafka\n        - add the entry in the db\n    - Redis consumer\n        - read message from kafka\n        - add it in the redis cache",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Used debezium here which reads the messages from the WAL\n- push them in the Kafka\n- Consumers\n    - database consumer \n        - reads the message from the kafka\n        - add the entry in the db\n    - Redis consumer\n        - read message from kafka\n        - add it in the redis cache",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
